Description: power-user utilities for Linux Mint Cinnamon
 MintToys is a set of small desktop tools for Linux Mint Cinnamon, inspired
 by Microsoft PowerToys, each switched on or off in one place and built on
 what Cinnamon already provides.
 .
 This release carries five tools: Awake keeps the computer from sleeping
 without changing the power settings; Light Switch switches between Linux
 Mint's day and dark modes on a schedule; Always on Top keeps a window above
 the others, framed; File Locksmith shows which processes hold a file open;
 New+ manages the templates of Nemo's Create New Document. They come with a
 panel icon, a settings window and the minttoys command.
